% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a triangle mesh in an Indexed space. Each vertex's one
% colour value is an index into a four-entry RGB table; a fourth vertex
% with a flag of 1 continues the first triangle along its second edge.
gsave
100 400 translate
<< /ShadingType 4 /ColorSpace [/Indexed /DeviceRGB 3 <ff0000 00ff00 0000ff ffff00>]
   /DataSource [ 0 0 0 0   0 100 0 1   0 50 80 2   1 150 80 3 ] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
